thub_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2790772154","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105210#issuecomment-2790772154","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105210","id":2790772154,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mV826","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T19:22:08Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T19:23:08Z","body":"> The previous PR made it impossible to dynamically cast FileAccess and DirAccess pointers for most of the derived classes\r\n\r\nFor future reference, it's still possible to use `dynamic_cast` on all `Object` types:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\nObject *object = ...;\r\nFileAccessCompressed *file_access_compressed = dynamic_cast<FileAccessCompressed>(object);\r\n```\r\n\r\nStill, adding `GDSOFTCLASS` and using `Object::cast_to` should preferred because it is way faster than `dynamic_cast`, so this is the correct fix in my opinion :)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/279